            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A statistical data analysis that uses patterns in the sample data to draw inferences about the population represented, accounting for randomness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Jie Zheng, Oliver He</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>significantly statistical data analysis</obo:IAO_0000118>
